 18 individual study pods with outlets along the Medical Center Library basement back hall.","source_url":"https://libraries.uky.edu/locations/mcl/mcl-spaces-technology","source_title":"MCL Spaces & Technology | UK Libraries","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"After-hours basement badge access is available to students enrolled in the six health sciences colleges.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"uk-education-library-quiet-study-area","subject_type":"study_space","entity_name":"Education Library Quiet Study Area","title":"Education Library Quiet Study Area","subtitle":"Education Library · Dickey Hall Room 227","notes":"Settle into the area designated for quiet study when you need fewer conversations; the library also provides open seating for individual or small-group work.","short_summary":"A quiet-study area inside the Education Library’s single main floor.","evidence_claim":"UK Libraries states that the Education Library in Room 227 of Dickey Hall has open seating and one corner dedicated to quiet study.","source_url":"https://libraries.uky.edu/locations/education-library/education-library-spaces-technology","source_title":"Education Library Spaces & Technology | UK Libraries","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Located in Room 227 on the Second Floor of Dickey Hall; library seating capacity is about 20 users.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true}],"warnings":[]}],"warnings":[]}
